### --------------------------------------------------------
### Import Endpoints (Operator — Tier 2)
### Requires: X-Security, X-App-Name (admin), X-Operator-Key
### --------------------------------------------------------

### Import tokens — JSON body
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

[
  {
    "userId": "user-001",
    "appName": "myapp",
    "expiresAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z"
  },
  {
    "userId": "user-002",
    "appName": "myapp"
  }
]

### Import tokens — CSV body
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/import
Content-Type: text/csv
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

userId,appName,expiresAt
user-003,myapp,2027-12-31T23:59:59Z
user-004,myapp,

### Import tokens — per-app (JSON, no appName in items)
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/import/myapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

[
  {
    "userId": "user-005",
    "expiresAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z"
  },
  {
    "userId": "user-006"
  }
]

### Import tokens — per-app (CSV, no appName column)
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/import/myapp
Content-Type: text/csv
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

userId,expiresAt
user-007,2027-12-31T23:59:59Z
user-008,

### Import — duplicate userId+appName (should return in errors[])
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

[
  {
    "userId": "user-001",
    "appName": "myapp"
  }
]
